 "text": "JP Morgan just locked AI agents out of your bank account. And honestly? They're right. Jamie Dimon said outside agents won't log in for customers. Citi said the same. Bank of America wants a person to approve every payment. Schwab is blocking agents every single week. Notice what they didn't ban. AI can still read. It just can't move money alone. That's the exact rule I run over 100 AI employees on. Draft everything. Send nothing without a yes. Want the five skills I start every AI employee with? Comment AI and I'll send them to you free."
